        "detailed_description": "<h1>Brand-New Demo 2.0 Now Live</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/5847eba2a553fa65883b1791937c7434.avif?t=1757476817\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras_big/5847eba2a553fa65883b1791937c7434.avif?t=1757476817 width=800 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Contact us at:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > QQ: 253625455</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bilibili: @ Sharewedo Studio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiktok: @ Sharewedo Studio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heybox: @ Sharewedo Studio Official</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weibo:@ Sharewedo Studio</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tieba: @ Furongren Bar/@ Furongren Tang Jianzhong Thirteen Bar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ACFun: @ Sharewedo Studio</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/ea3be08e161dc181d4b1cc3f4d997d6d.webp?t=1757476817\" width=377 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of the An Lushan Rebellion, the Tang Empire is in decline. With the Western Regions in chaos and the Tibetan Empire (Tubo) advancing, Liuzhong City stands as the Tang’s final bastion in Xizhou. Two years after a devastating loss at Beiting, Tubo gathers its forces for a final assault. Inside the city walls, Captain Li Yan struggles to hold the line, while his children—Li Si'an, determined to rally the people, and Yun'er, haunted by family secrets—seek purpose amid the storm. When a mysterious old outsider and a young girl stumble into the city, fate begins to shift. In this war-torn land, will Liuzhong stand or fall?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/4e6ee43ebdfb20141b4ef37496815f71.webp?t=1757476817\" width=377 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/608a1420826d09df526a90f8df526902.avif?t=1757476817\" width=441 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Li Yan: As the commander-in-chief of Puchang Zhechong Prefecture, at the age of 47, he was defeated by the invasion of Tubo and eventually retreated to Liuzhong City, preparing to defend. However, facing the deteriorating situation of the river and river, he was more interested in finding a way out for the people in the city than defending a city for the Tang Dynasty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/6b3117bd5ae9bf50b3e1bbe159795981.avif?t=1757476817\" width=441 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wen Qinli: Pu Chang was appointed as the Chief Historian of Chongfu, and served in the Ming Dynasty during the reign of Emperor Suzong. At the age of fifty-three, he not only dealt with various documents, but also devoted himself to education, striving to preserve the cultural foundation of the Han people with all his might. He constantly worried about the collapse of his thoughts, hoping that the sage's ideas could eventually save this city from fire and water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/25a9e143d95301450b427aa83712b766.avif?t=1757476817\" width=441 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zhao Shangwu: A lieutenant under the Puchang army, at the age of eighteen. His father was saved by Li Yan and he was also his confidant. I am extremely grateful for Li Yan's kindness and loyal, but at the same time, I am also a good friend of Li Sian, and they face difficulties in both aspects of their family affairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/76a0a701af6d883f8564dcd311d9e853.avif?t=1757476817\" width=441 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Qixin Er: The captured Tibetan priestess, according to her, was never welcomed in Tibet. Her thoughts are diverse, and she has unique perspectives on the times and human nature in her eyes. Buddha's words: Bodhi mind is the cause, sorrow is the root, and convenience is the ultimate goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/2c7c7fe729e1c9ea288ba5c0d4ff4d3d.avif?t=1757476817\" width=441 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Li Sian: Li Yan's second son, at the age of eighteen, is currently studying under Wen Qinli. He is both dissatisfied and fearful of his father, but also hopes to be recognized by him. His elder brother, who died in battle, became an unavoidable knot in his heart. Now he is running around the city, trying his best to do something, but it seems that nothing can be changed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/55f0e6ab293327775706897fbce9ba9f.avif?t=1757476817\" width=441 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Li Yun'er: Li Yan's eldest daughter, the third in the family and the last child of Li Yan. She is fourteen years old and has been weak and sickly since childhood. She realizes that her mother passed away because of her, and her father's avoidance of this has made her increasingly curious about all of this. She is curious about her mother and her father, and even more curious about how all of this actually developed to this point. However, these questions have not yet been answered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/3dabf705ee6880cf313f1f51a74337d6.avif?t=1757476817\" width=441 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liu Yue'er: A young girl who was caught in the city while gasping for breath in the war. She claimed to be the daughter of an old friend of Li Yan, at the age of sixteen, but seemed to hide a different identity and motive. The current situation is complex and intricate, and she is equally enigmatic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >……</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/b2b8fa57f4edff3d001ba49e9d587560.webp?t=1757476817\" width=377 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a unique visual style combining Chinese ink painting, Western techniques, and anime aesthetics—blending freehand expression with realism. Inspired by Tang Dynasty culture, its art, UI, and sound design aim for historical authenticity and modern appeal. The UI merges classic Galgame interaction with innovative, customizable features, enhancing player immersion. Music blends traditional instruments with electronic elements, evoking the grandeur and underlying tension of a fading golden age. Rich sound effects and dynamic CG animations bring the world vividly to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/d56a039ed45f9c0ea90e1bcfc2fe36b5.webp?t=1757476817\" width=377 height=62 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Staff] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production Team: Sharewedo Studio：Project-《We Who Remain: Tang Chronicles 》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead Creators: Resher、Link</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead Screenwriter: Link</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Manager: Resher  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business: Resher  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programmer: Guwan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Original Art: yakami  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario Original Art: Kejinghua</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG Original Art: yakami、Kejinghua  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appreciation Items Art/Partial Posters: Malatang</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merchandise Art: selah</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music/Sound Effects: Pengream</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vocal Music: Yujie An、Jiasen Liu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PV Animation: Chaijinzhi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Effects: Yuanyue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance: Resher、Guwan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI/Art Promotion: Resher  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UI Base Assets: Lielinfeng</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/ea3be08e161dc181d4b1cc3f4d997d6d.webp?t=1757476817\" width=377 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of the An Lushan Rebellion, the Tang Empire is in decline. With the Western Regions in chaos and the Tibetan Empire (Tubo) advancing, Liuzhong City stands as the Tang’s final bastion in Xizhou. Two years after a devastating loss at Beiting, Tubo gathers its forces for a final assault. Inside the city walls, Captain Li Yan struggles to hold the line, while his children—Li Si'an, determined to rally the people, and Yun'er, haunted by family secrets—seek purpose amid the storm. When a mysterious old outsider and a young girl stumble into the city, fate begins to shift. In this war-torn land, will Liuzhong stand or fall?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/4e6ee43ebdfb20141b4ef37496815f71.webp?t=1757476817\" width=377 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/608a1420826d09df526a90f8df526902.avif?t=1757476817\" width=441 height=272 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Li Yan: As the commander-in-chief of Puchang Zhechong Prefecture, at the age of 47, he was defeated by the invasion of Tubo and eventually retreated to Liuzhong City, preparing to defend. However, facing the deteriorating situation of the river and river, he was more interested in finding a way out for the people in the city than defending a city for the Tang Dynasty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app