3620/extras/b2b8fa57f4edff3d001ba49e9d587560.webp?t=1757476817\" width=377 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a unique visual style combining Chinese ink painting, Western techniques, and anime aesthetics—blending freehand expression with realism. Inspired by Tang Dynasty culture, its art, UI, and sound design aim for historical authenticity and modern appeal. The UI merges classic Galgame interaction with innovative, customizable features, enhancing player immersion. Music blends traditional instruments with electronic elements, evoking the grandeur and underlying tension of a fading golden age. Rich sound effects and dynamic CG animations bring the world vividly to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353620/extras/d56a039ed45f9c0ea90e1bcfc2fe36b5.webp?t=1757476817\" width=377 height=62 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Staff] </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Production Team: Sharewedo Studio：Project-《We Who Remain: Tang Chronicles 》</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead Creators: Resher、Link</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead Screenwriter: Link</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Manager: Resher  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Business: Resher  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Programmer: Guwan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character Original Art: yakami  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenario Original Art: Kejinghua</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CG Original Art: yakami、Kejinghua  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Appreciation Items Art/Partial Posters: Malatang</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merchandise Art: selah</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music/Sound Effects: Pengream</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vocal Music: Yujie An、Jiasen Liu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PV Animation: Chaijinzhi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Effects: Yuanyue</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Performance: Resher、Guwan</p><p class=